S147 LRC14 BAIRE / HAAR / ANY-ANGLE CARRIER
==============================================================================
[0] Scope
  Vertices considered: Borel events, Baire events, Haar measure, finite
  endpoint boundaries, Field D*, Theta*, Block A*, ANYA, CWave, and a
  sixth Haar-Baire Taut Wave* carrier.
  Chosen quotient: regular-open event carriers with exact M/Farey and
  C27/K33 owner labels retained.
  Destroyed data: raw runner identities and unlabelled grid-edge paths.

[1] Finite LRC14 circle events as Borel/Baire/Haar objects
  danger(v) = {t in R/Z : ||v*t|| < 1/14}
  each danger(v) is a finite union of arcs; finite Boolean combinations
  are Borel, Baire, regular-open up to finite endpoint debt.

  row                 danger_mu    safe_mu safe comps   bdry  raw bdry readout
  AP                          1          0          0      1       182 no open Haar/Baire witness; endpoint-only residual
  GW 12->24                   1          0          0      1       206 no open Haar/Baire witness; endpoint-only residual
  near/K33 12->36     1259/1260     1/1260          2      5       230 positive open witness interval(s)
